<title>PORTUGAL: Portucel to post results February 25.</title>
<headline>Portucel to post results February 25.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portucel Industrial-Empresa Produtora de Celulose, the state-controlled pulp and paper group, will present its 1996 results on February 25, a company spokesman said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>First half 1997 results will be issued on July 31.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3113121</p>
</text>
